## Loading it

Open `{{name}}.owl` in Protégé, or load it from its IRI once the persistent IRI resolves. The
release is merged with its imports and reasoned with HermiT; `{{name}}-base.owl` holds this
ontology's own axioms only, for reuse in other ontologies.

```python
from rdflib import Graph
g = Graph().parse("{{name}}.ttl")
```

## Audit

This release was audited with OwlTester. `VERIFICATION.md` states the result and lists the
checksum of every file; check it with `owltester verify {{name}}-{{version}}.zip --reaudit`.

